{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07276","headline":"送严维赴河南充严中丞幕府 · 刘长卿","name":"送严维赴河南充严中丞幕府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久别耶溪客，来乘使者轩。\n用才荣入幕，扶病喜同樽。\n山屐留何处，江帆去独翻。\n暮情辞镜水，秋梦识云门。\n莲府开花萼，桃园寄子孙。\n何当举严助，徧沐汉朝恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}